 [1536, 64], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 75, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 76, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "tile_size"}, "name": "tile_size", "label": "tile_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "tile_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "overlap"}, "name": "overlap", "label": "overlap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "overlap"}], "flags": {}, "id": 53, "type": "VAEDecodeAudioTiled", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudioTiled"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax Music 3\n\nA music generation model by MiniMax that creates complete songs up to 5 minutes long with stable structure and high audio quality. Two inputs drive it: **Caption** (structured music description: style, mood, vocals, arrangement) and **Lyrics** (with `[intro]` `[verse]` `[chorus]` `[bridge]` `[outro]` tags controlling song structure).\n\n### Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Description |\n|---|---|\n| Caption | Music description. Write it in three sections — Global Metadata → Vocal Details → Arrangement. The more specific, the closer the result. |\n| Lyrics | Song lyrics + section tags. Tags are the only executable structural instructions; the lyric text itself only conveys mood. |\n| max_duration | Target song length in seconds (default 120 = 2 minutes; the model supports up to ~300 s / 5 minutes). Longer songs take more time and VRAM. |\n| seed | Random seed for the generation. Keep it fixed to reproduce the same song; change it to get a different take. |\n| Model files | diffusion model / text encoder / VAE.|\n| Tiled decode | Decode the audio VAE in overlapping tiles to drastically cut VRAM usage — helpful for long songs on low-VRAM GPUs. Slightly slower, with a small risk of seams at tile boundaries; turn it off on high-VRAM GPUs for the best quality. |\n\n### Prompt Writing Guide\n\nYou can find an official [Music Caption Rewriter Skill here](https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-Music3)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax Music 3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [520, 660], "pos": [34.89022445678711, -722.3666381835938], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [210, 106], "pos": [3017.861572265625, -588.1210327148438], "widgets_values": ["audio/audio_minimax_music3", "mp3", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 79, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "format"}, {"widget": {"name": "format.quality"}, "name": "format.quality", "label": "format.quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}], "flags": {}, "id": 35, "type": "SaveAudioAdvanced", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioAdvanced"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [79], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [270, 110], "pos": [2617.002197265625, -485.3319091796875], "widgets_values": [false], "inputs": [{"name": "on_false", "link": 77, "label": "on_false", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "on_false"}, {"name": "on_true", "link": 78, "label": "on_true", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "on_true"}, {"widget": {"name": "switch"}, "name": "switch", "label": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "switch"}], "flags": {}, "id": 54, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widge